    "updated_at": "2020-05-11T19:27:26Z",
    "body": "It looks like the spec still does not do this, but it would be much easier to change now. I think it's just a matter of changing https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#fetch-an-import()-module-script-graph step 3 to pass _base URL_ instead of \"client\".",
