    "body": "Ah, I just remembered there're also hand-written tests including ```import()```:\r\n- https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/fc5fe7e3cc426b2b40440201d52511facf11961c/workers/modules/dedicated-worker-import-referrer.html\r\n- https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/fc5fe7e3cc426b2b40440201d52511facf11961c/workers/modules/shared-worker-import-referrer.html\r\n\r\nIt would be nice to move these tests into the test generator framework.",
